---
// Quiz figure for the post "Design before prompting": the same assign-a-task screen twice, colour switched off.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq01graypair">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 270" role="img" aria-label="Two grayscale versions of an Assign task form. Screen A: title and labels look alike, and the Assign and Cancel buttons are the same size with the same light fill. Screen B: a larger bold title, a dark filled Assign button and a plain text Cancel.">
    <text x="150" y="22" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Screen A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Màn A</tspan></text>
    <rect x="20" y="34" width="260" height="226" rx="8" class="card" />
    <text x="38" y="62" class="t1">Assign task</text>
    <text x="38" y="90" class="t1"><tspan data-lang-en>Title</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tiêu đề</tspan></text>
    <rect x="38" y="98" width="224" height="26" rx="4" class="field" />
    <text x="38" y="150" class="t1"><tspan data-lang-en>Assignee</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Người nhận</tspan></text>
    <rect x="38" y="158" width="224" height="26" rx="4" class="field" />
    <rect x="38" y="208" width="104" height="32" rx="4" class="btnl" />
    <text x="90" y="229" class="t1" text-anchor="middle">Assign</text>
    <rect x="158" y="208" width="104" height="32" rx="4" class="btnl" />
    <text x="210" y="229" class="t1" text-anchor="middle">Cancel</text>

    <text x="450" y="22" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Screen B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Màn B</tspan></text>
    <rect x="320" y="34" width="260" height="226" rx="8" class="card" />
    <text x="338" y="66" class="t2">Assign task</text>
    <text x="338" y="92" class="t3"><tspan data-lang-en>Title</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tiêu đề</tspan></text>
    <rect x="338" y="98" width="224" height="26" rx="4" class="field" />
    <text x="338" y="150" class="t3"><tspan data-lang-en>Assignee</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Người nhận</tspan></text>
    <rect x="338" y="158" width="224" height="26" rx="4" class="field" />
    <rect x="338" y="204" width="130" height="38" rx="4" class="btnd" />
    <text x="403" y="228" class="tw" text-anchor="middle">Assign</text>
    <text x="520" y="228" class="t3" text-anchor="middle">Cancel</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq01graypair { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .t1 { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .t2 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .t3 { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .tw { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--bg); }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .field { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .btnl { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq01graypair .btnd { fill: var(--text); }
</style>
